      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Ceres Historical Museum, housed in the Daniel Whitmore House next to the town’s first home, opens only by appointment with curator Sheryl Trout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
